{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>When I send you and your little ones.</b> How much more so shall I send even the flocks and the cattle, as you said!" "<b>See that evil is before your faces.</b> As the Targum renders. And the Sages say: I have heard — there is one star whose name is Ra'ah. Pharaoh said to them: I see in my astrology that that star is rising to meet you in the wilderness, and it is a sign of blood and slaughter. And when Israel sinned with the calf and the Holy One, blessed be He, sought to kill them, Moses said in his prayer: ״לָמָּה יֹאמְרוּ מִצְרַיִם לֵאמֹר בְּרָעָה הוֹצִיאָם״ (Exodus 32) — this is what he [Pharaoh] said to them: ״רְאוּ כִּי רָעָה נֶגֶד פְּנֵיכֶם.״ Immediately — ״וַיִּנָּחֶם HaShem עַל הָרָעָה״ — and He turned the blood into the blood of circumcision, for Joshua circumcised them, and this is what is written: ״הַיּוֹם גַּלּוֹתִי אֶת חֶרְפַּת מִצְרַיִם מֵעֲלֵיכֶם״ (Joshua 5) — for they were saying to you: We see blood upon you in the wilderness."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:23.896199218Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}